WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,520 --> 00:00:08,240
This backpack is not a space prop

2
00:00:08,240 --> 00:00:16,250
Show it to me

3
00:00:16,250 --> 00:00:28,700
that moment

4
00:00:28,700 --> 00:00:29,700
my power is gone

5
00:00:29,700 --> 00:00:31,960
There's something wrong with this human being

6
00:00:31,960 --> 00:00:34,500
Sorry Secretary-General

7
00:00:34,500 --> 00:00:36,500
I didn't know you hated people touching you so much

8
00:00:36,500 --> 00:00:37,500
but i didn't mean it

9
00:00:37,500 --> 00:00:39,500
If you want to see inside the backpack

10
00:00:39,500 --> 00:00:40,500
I should have said it in advance

11
00:00:40,500 --> 00:00:42,500
After all, these are my personal belongings.

12
00:00:42,500 --> 00:00:45,500
I packed a change of underwear inside.

13
00:00:45,500 --> 00:00:46,690
it's my problem

14
00:00:46,690 --> 00:00:47,980
Then clean it up

15
00:00:47,980 --> 00:00:49,980
Open it and show it to me

16
00:00:49,980 --> 00:00:50,980
Don’t you have to watch this package?

17
00:00:50,980 --> 00:00:53,980
But in the future, your boss still needs to please you appropriately.

18
00:00:53,980 --> 00:00:54,980
I'll pack my backpack

19
00:00:54,980 --> 00:01:00,950
Just wait a moment. I'll give it to you.
